1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:05,330
Enterprise Singapore has consolidated its main business grants.

2
00:00:05,680 --> 00:00:14,090
PSG, EDG and MRA ceased on 29 September 2026, and from 30 September, new applications go through the EDGE Grant.

3
00:00:14,590 --> 00:00:23,240
Ongoing PSG, EDG and MRA applications and projects continue to be processed, and claims can be submitted on project completion.

4
00:00:23,740 --> 00:00:30,630
Support levels, caps and eligibility for the EDGE Grant are set by Enterprise Singapore and may change.

5
00:00:30,980 --> 00:00:37,060
If a scanning project was planned around a PSG package, re-check it against the EDGE terms.

6
00:00:37,560 --> 00:00:49,720
To prepare, read the current terms, scope volumes, document types, indexing and retention, ask for an itemised quotation, and do not sign or pay before you understand the rules.

7
00:00:50,220 --> 00:00:55,050
Whether a project qualifies is decided by Enterprise Singapore, not by any vendor.

8
00:00:55,400 --> 00:01:01,180
Public-sector buyers can procure through GeBIZ, where Micrographics Data is a registered supplier.

9
00:01:01,680 --> 00:01:07,310
Micrographics Data can scope your digitisation project and issue an itemised quotation.

10
00:01:07,660 --> 00:01:10,570
Request a quote at micrographicsdata.com.
